                <invention-title lang="de">REFERENZSIGNALÜBERTRAGUNGS- UND PARAMETERSENDEVERFAHREN, VORRICHTUNG, ENDGERÄT UND BASISSTATION</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉS D'ÉMISSION DE SIGNAL DE RÉFÉRENCE ET D'ENVOI DE PARAMÈTRE, DISPOSITIF, TERMINAL ET STATION DE BASE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">REFERENCE SIGNAL TRANSMISSION AND PARAMETER SENDING METHODS, DEVICE, TERMINAL AND BASE STATION</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided are a reference signal transmission method and device, a terminal and a storage medium. The reference signal transmission method includes: determining B+1 frequency domain bandwidth levels indexed by b=0, 1, ..., B for a reference signal; determining a frequency hopping bandwidth level set from the B+1 frequency domain bandwidth levels; and determining frequency domain positions occupied by each transmission of the reference signal according to frequency domain bandwidth index of the reference signal in each of the B+1 frequency domain bandwidth levels.</p>
            </abstract>
